{"title":"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the following function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> defined as \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da37d7e641f65e65700d6574e6546587720b0199.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^{2^{2008}-1}-1)g(x) = (x+1)(x^2+1)(x^4+1)\\cdots (x^{2^{2007}}+1) - 1\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"23\" />\nFind <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed6ee027bb5823e31562c577a2c4fa2ab51fcf9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />; the right hand side collapses by the reverse of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/f/06f6613a065ec7906f4df62c7808b9da5866261e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}(x-1)(x^{2^{2008}-1}-1)g(x) &amp;= (x-1)(x+1)(x^2+1)(x^4+1)\\cdots (x^{2^{2007}}+1) - (x-1)\\\\ &amp;= (x^2-1) (x^2+1)(x^4+1)\\cdots (x^{2^{2007}}+1) - (x-1)\\\\ &amp;= \\cdots\\\\ &amp;= \\left(x^{2^{2008}}-1\\right) - (x-1) = x^{2^{2008}} - x \\end{align*}\" width=\"645\" height=\"118\" />\nSubstituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/4/8948f9f2a7545f68353ee2b2216e8c02e0074ede.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(2^{2^{2008}-1}-1\\right) \\cdot g(2) = 2^{2^{2008}}-2 = 2\\left(2^{2^{2008}-1}-1\\right)\\]\" width=\"390\" height=\"32\" />\nDividing both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd979646e6c8bbbee3b773d2e2f901929f048ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2^{2008}-1}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"21\" />, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4baaa89d3a3c89c9ffcad93514b8c2770826b800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(2) = \\boxed{002}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008\">Mock AIME 1 2007-2008</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=196980\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018035648\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 116/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1442/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 200/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1941/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.162      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.162      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6654:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018035648 and revision id 220082. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}